# You design and build LEGO Technic models one step at a time, in a build language.
# 
# For each step you write:
# ADD name partnumber color
# CONNECT part.point -> part.point LOCKED|TURNS|STIFF   (points: hole1.., axlehole1.., pin1.., axle1.., clip1..; LOCKED = cross in cross, turn together; TURNS = free; STIFF = friction pin)
# Optional: MESH a.teeth b.teeth / RATIO a b x/y / GROUP g (opens a side build) / END (closes it) / ATTACH g (joins a finished side build into the main model)
# WHY one plain sentence: what this step builds and what it is for.
# A point ending in ~ is an estimate; ? means not known.
# 
# Rules: only use real points of each part; a round pin never goes in a cross hole; a shaft that must turn needs round holes; a worm needs stops on both sides; gears must sit at the right distance.
STEP 1
ADD p64178-1 64178 lightgray
ADD p6558-1 6558 blue
ADD p6558-2 6558 blue
ADD p2780-1 2780 black
ADD p2780-2 2780 black
CONNECT p6558-1.pin1 -> p64178-1.hole28 STIFF
CONNECT p6558-2.pin1 -> p64178-1.hole27 STIFF
CONNECT p2780-1.pin1 -> p64178-1.hole18 STIFF
CONNECT p2780-2.pin2 -> p64178-1.hole19 STIFF
WHY Starts the rear chassis with a rigid grey frame and two matching pairs of outward mounting pins.
STEP 2
ADD p55013-1 55013 darkgray
ADD p18575-1 18575 tan
ADD p6589-1 6589 tan
CONNECT p55013-1.axle7 -> p18575-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p55013-1.axle6 -> p6589-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Puts the twenty-tooth gear and smaller bevel gear on the same stopped shaft so they turn together.
STEP 3
CONNECT p55013-1.axle2 -> p64178-1.hole7 TURNS
CONNECT p55013-1.axle8 -> p64178-1.hole22 TURNS
WHY Inserts the geared shaft through the frame's central round bearings so both gears remain free to rotate.
STEP 4
GROUP rear-upright-bearings
ADD p43093-1 43093 blue
ADD p43093-2 43093 blue
ADD p32184-1 32184 black
ADD p32184-2 32184 black
ADD p18651-1 18651 black
ADD p18651-2 18651 black
ADD p6632-1 6632 lightgray
ADD p6632-2 6632 lightgray
CONNECT p43093-1.axle1 -> p32184-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p43093-2.axle1 -> p32184-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p18651-1.axle2 -> p32184-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p18651-2.axle2 -> p32184-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p18651-1.axle1 -> p6632-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p18651-1.axle1 -> p6632-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p18651-2.axle1 -> p6632-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p18651-2.axle1 -> p6632-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH rear-upright-bearings
CONNECT p43093-1.pin1 -> p64178-1.hole6 STIFF
CONNECT p43093-2.pin1 -> p64178-1.hole8 STIFF
WHY Builds and mounts the paired upright bearings with doubled thin cross braces above the chassis frame.
STEP 5
ADD p4519-1 4519 lightgray
ADD p18575-2 18575 tan
ADD p59443-1 59443 darkgray
CONNECT p4519-1.axle3 -> p59443-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p4519-1.axle2 -> p64178-1.hole15 TURNS
CONNECT p4519-1.axle1 -> p18575-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
MESH p6589-1.teeth p18575-2.teeth
RATIO p6589-1 p18575-2 12/20
WHY Adds the transverse twenty-tooth output gear, turning the bevel drive through ninety degrees toward the wheel axle.
STEP 6
ADD p3749-1 3749 tan
ADD p59443-2 59443 darkgray
CONNECT p3749-1.axle1 -> p59443-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p3749-1.pin1 -> p64178-1.hole14 TURNS
WHY Fits the opposite axle joiner on a frictionless pin so that side can turn freely in the frame.
STEP 7
GROUP rear-wheel-carriers
ADD p32062-1 32062 red
ADD p32062-2 32062 red
ADD p32062-3 32062 red
ADD p32062-4 32062 red
ADD p32062-5 32062 red
ADD p32062-6 32062 red
ADD p32062-7 32062 red
ADD p32062-8 32062 red
ADD p32449-1 32449 yellow
ADD p32449-2 32449 yellow
ADD p32449-3 32449 yellow
ADD p32449-4 32449 yellow
ADD p32184-3 32184 black
ADD p32184-4 32184 black
CONNECT p32062-4.axle2 -> p32449-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-3.axle2 -> p32449-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-2.axle2 -> p32449-3.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-1.axle2 -> p32449-4.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-5.axle2 -> p32449-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-6.axle2 -> p32449-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-7.axle2 -> p32449-4.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-8.axle2 -> p32449-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-5.axle1 -> p32184-3.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-6.axle1 -> p32184-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-7.axle1 -> p32184-4.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-8.axle1 -> p32184-4.axlehole2 LOCKED
END
ATTACH rear-wheel-carriers
CONNECT p32062-1.axle1 -> p64178-1.hole13 TURNS
CONNECT p32062-2.axle1 -> p64178-1.hole17 TURNS
CONNECT p32062-3.axle1 -> p64178-1.hole12 TURNS
CONNECT p32062-4.axle1 -> p64178-1.hole16 TURNS
WHY Mounts the two wheel carriers on paired yellow arms that pivot in the frame while holding the carriers parallel.
STEP 8
ADD p32449-5 32449 yellow
ADD p32449-6 32449 yellow
ADD p32449-7 32449 yellow
ADD p32449-8 32449 yellow
CONNECT p32062-1.axle1 -> p32449-6.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-2.axle1 -> p32449-5.axlehole2 LOCKED
