CONNECT p32062-5.axle1 -> p32449-8.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-6.axle1 -> p32449-7.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-7.axle1 -> p32449-6.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32062-8.axle1 -> p32449-5.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Doubles all four yellow carrier arms above the frame without locking their round chassis pivots.
STEP 9
ADD p3705-1 3705 black
ADD p3705-2 3705 black
ADD p32123b-1 32123b lightgray
ADD p32123b-2 32123b lightgray
CONNECT p3705-1.axle1 -> p59443-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p3705-1.axle2 -> p32184-4.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT p3705-1.axle3 -> p32123b-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p3705-2.axle4 -> p59443-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT p3705-2.axle3 -> p32184-3.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT p3705-2.axle2 -> p32123b-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Inserts the two wheel shafts through the carriers into the inner joiners and retains them with half bushes.
STEP 10
GROUP rear-transfer-drive
ADD p32184-5 32184 black
ADD p4519-2 4519 lightgray
CONNECT p4519-2.axle1 -> p32184-5.axlehole2 LOCKED
WHY Starts the transfer-drive support with a short cross axle through its lower bearing lug.
STEP 11
ADD p6536-1 6536 yellow
ADD p32034-1 32034 black
CONNECT p4519-2.axle2 -> p6536-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p4519-2.axle3 -> p32034-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
