STEP 15
ADD p55013-2 55013 darkgray
ADD p18575-3 18575 tan
CONNECT p55013-2.axle8 -> p6536-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT p55013-2.axle7 -> p18575-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Inserts the stopped transfer shaft into a round yellow bearing and slides its twenty-tooth gear into position.
STEP 16
ADD p32526-1 32526 yellow
ADD p44294-1 44294 yellow
ADD p3713-1 3713 red
ADD p94925-1 94925 lightgray
CONNECT p44294-1.axle1 -> p3713-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p44294-1.axle2 -> p32526-1.hole3 TURNS
CONNECT p44294-1.axle3 -> p94925-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p44294-1.axle4 -> p32034-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT p43093-3.pin1 -> p32526-1.hole1 STIFF
